[?9001h[?1004h[?25l[2J[m[2;1H]0;C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe[?25hNAME
    Get-ConsoleCapability
    
SYNOPSIS
    Shows what ConsoleMonster detected about the current 
    terminal.
    
    Returns the terminal profile: kind, mode (Interactive, 
    Stream, Plain), colour depth, glyph tier, size, VT 
    support, console font and the reasons behind each 
    decision. -Refresh detects again (after a resize or 
    font change).
    
    
    EXAMPLE 1
    
    Get-ConsoleCapability | Select-Object -ExpandProperty 
    Decisions
    
[?25l    Show the profile and the decisions[24;1H[?25h
